compressed_dot_perturbation ⊢ ∀r off den ws xs ys a e.
    kernel_ok r off den ws ∧ LENGTH ws = LENGTH xs ∧ 0 ≤ e ∧
    LIST_REL (λx y. ABS (x − y) ≤ e) xs (MAP (λy. a * y) ys) ⇒
    ABS (dot ws xs − a * dot ws ys) ≤ 5 * den * e
